WEBVTT

00:02:28.436 --> 00:02:31.397
let’s have the same
for Mweituria the elephant,

00:02:31.439 --> 00:02:34.442
Ataia the Jaguar, Fio the orangutan

00:02:34.483 --> 00:02:36.444
and hundreds of thousands more.

00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:39.864
And the events of their lives,
as supported by the data,

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:42.200
can be recreated digitally.

00:02:42.241 --> 00:02:45.411
That might be the health of Fio,

00:02:45.453 --> 00:02:47.413
the migration of Mweituria,

00:02:47.455 --> 00:02:49.707
a newborn cub to Ataia.

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:53.669
And these events, and others,

00:02:53.711 --> 00:02:55.421
create the moments

00:02:55.463 --> 00:02:58.466
for people to feel the space
to feel emotionally bonded.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.970
Not because they all of a sudden want to,